# Hero pipeline: set size = 5

## User rule (standing)

When the user asks for a place/character **set** (e.g. "Sedona mit diaz", "Big Sur set"), default is **5 pics**.

- Do **not** suggest a single-shot or 3-shot set unless they explicitly say fewer (`1x`, `nur main`, `activity-only`, `window_down`, etc.).
- Targeted `--character` runs **fill to 5** in code: budget 5, arrival on, multiple activities, farshot reserved on nature/vast — not score-gated 3.
- Keep dry-run default; no `--no-dry-run` unless they ask for upload.

## Command shape

```bash
python3 generate_hero_images.py --us --safe --character CHAR \
  --only-ids PLACE_UUID \
  --include-existing-cast --limit 1
```

(EU: `--eu --safe` instead of `--us --safe` as appropriate.)
